  "description": "Operating Area: Greek Islands\n\nThe 88 ft/ 26m Ferretti 880 motor yacht Estia Yi was built in 2004 by Ferretti and she has been through an extensive full refit in 2021. M/Y Estia Orion (ex Estia Yi) offers 4 lavish staterooms that accommodate up to 10 guests super comfortably. Her layout includes a master suite, a VIP cabin and 2 twin cabins (one with an extra pullman berth), all with ensuite facilities. Her professional and experienced crew of 5 members take care of Estia Yi’s guests on board promising a once in a lifetime yachting experience.The 88 ft/ 26m Ferretti 880 motor yacht Estia Yi was built in 2004 by Ferretti and she has been through an extensive full refit in 2021. M/Y Estia Yi offers 4 lavish staterooms that accommodate up to 8+1 guests super comfortably. Her layout includes a master suite, a VIP cabin and 2 twin cabins (one with an extra pullman berth), all with ensuite facilities. Her professional and experienced crew of 5 members take care of Estia Yi’s guests on board promising a once in a lifetime yachting experience.",
